{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2021-09-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'SALESFORCE GIVES $19M TO SCHOOLS', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, SEPT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SALESFORCE (NYSE: CRM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED $17.25 MILLION IN NEW GRANTS TO SUPPORT FIVE SCHOOL DISTRICTS ACROSS THE UNITED STATES – SAN FRANCISCO UNIFIED SCHOOL DISTRICT, OAKLAND UNIFIED SCHOOL DISTRICT, CHICAGO PUBLIC SCHOOLS, INDIANAPOLIS PUBLIC SCHOOLS, AND THE NEW YORK CITY DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION.'}